        "thalia": "hit",
        "wolf": "hit",
        "guards": "hit",
        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the council chamber includes the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including elite guards); no council members are explicitly confirmed present in the projection.\n\nEvidence:\n- Players: \u201cParty is actively in battle\u201d and they \u201crecount their story to the council\u201d prior, placing them in the chamber during the confrontation (Entity: Players, OBSERVED operational_status & governance).\n- the Wolf: Explicitly located in the \u201cCouncil Room\u201d and is the \u201cadversary\u2026in the council chamber battle\u201d (Entity: the Wolf, OBSERVED current_location; CANON role).\n- Thalia: \u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder\u201d and she \u201cattacks the group after the Wolf's instruction\u201d (Entity: Thalia, OBSERVED current_location & goals).\n- Guards: \u201cBoth elite guards attack members of the party\u201d and guards are \u201cactively stopping people outside Council Chambers\u201d with reinforcements being drawn in (Entity: Guards, OBSERVED operational_status; CANON council_room current_location).\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Combatants: Players (6), the Wolf, Thalia, Guards (8 regular + 2 elite, some corrupted)\n- Environment: Council Chambers (large circular room, magical defenses, illusory walls, trapdoor)\n- Reinforcements: Guards being drawn into the chamber\n\nAnalysis:\nNo explicit mention of council members being physically present during the fight, despite earlier council interaction.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
