      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds are a cult known as the Shepherd\u2019s Flock, and they serve Maelthor, acting in alignment with his influence and emergence.\n\nEvidence:\n- Shepherd\u2019s Flock: faction is \u201cfollowers of Maelthor\u201d [OBSERVED]\n- Shepherd\u2019s Flock: \u201cAligned with Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence\u201d [OBSERVED]\n- Shepherd\u2019s Flock: goals include recruiting, \u201ccleans[ing] the world of impurities resisting Maelthor\u2019s influence,\u201d and ensuring human supremacy [CANON]\n- Shepherd\u2019s Flock: role is \u201cShepherd's Flock cultists are staging the protest\u201d [CANON]\n- Shepherd\u2019s Flock: actively recruiting transformed individuals [OBSERVED]\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Faction: Cult followers of Maelthor  \n- Goals: Recruitment, ideological \u201ccleansing,\u201d human supremacy  \n- Role: Protest organizers and covert recruiters  \n- Behavior: Justify harmful acts as necessary sacrifices for a greater good tied to Maelthor",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
      "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
