      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin is the Guilds\u2019 representative (Master Smith), Rurik is the infrastructure lead (Chief Architect), and Merril is not defined in the provided context.\n\nEvidence:\n- Torrin Flamescale: Holds the titles \u201cMaster Smith and Representative of the Guilds\u201d and serves as \u201cRepresentative of the Craft Guilds\u201d (OBSERVED: fact_torrin_flamescale_rank_or_title_6a53d8a8f185, fact_torrin_flamescale_role_238a0309fe51).\n- Rurik Stonehammer: Holds the title \u201cChief Architect\u201d and serves as \u201cRepresentative of Infrastructure,\u201d responsible for the city\u2019s structural integrity (OBSERVED: fact_rurik_stonehammer_rank_or_title_cc7a30c31034; CANON: fact_rurik_stonehammer_role_2741a858baa0, fact_rurik_stonehammer_governance_380b1ea8bb1b).\n- Merril: No matching entity or role appears in the projection context.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Torrin Flamescale: Master Smith; Representative of the Guilds\n- Rurik Stonehammer: Chief Architect; Infrastructure representative; oversees structural integrity\n- Merril: Not present in context (role unknown)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_battle_with_the_wolf_and_aftermath_1",
