      "answer": "TL;DR: Before the council fight, the Wolf is an active, deceptive infiltrator manipulating events; after, he\u2019s a broken, exposed cultist\u2014\u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d\u2014and mentally desperate, showing regret and loss of control.\n\nEvidence:\n- the Wolf (role): \u201cSaboteur; adversary\u2026 in the council chamber battle\u201d (CANON)\n- the Wolf (goals): attempts to \u201csteer discussion in the wrong direction,\u201d \u201cdownplay the threat,\u201d and escape via invisibility and secret tunnel (OBSERVED)\n- the Wolf (defenses): creates \u201cillusory duplicates\u2026 as decoys\u201d (CANON)\n- the Wolf (operational_status): \u201cDowned an Invisibility Potion,\u201d \u201cattempting to escape,\u201d \u201crushes\u2026 to disengage\u201d (OBSERVED)\n- the Wolf (loyalty_or_alignment_context): \u201cbetrayed the city\u2026 cult sympathizer\u201d (OBSERVED)\n- the Wolf (physical_condition): \u201cWolf has an oily sheen to his eyes\u201d (OBSERVED)\n- the Wolf (mental_state): \u201cSensed danger,\u201d \u201cdesperate\u201d (OBSERVED)\n\nAfter:\n- the Wolf (physical_condition): \u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d (OBSERVED)\n- the Wolf (mental_state): \u201cbegging\u2026 to release him,\u201d \u201cbegging to be killed,\u201d \u201cfeels regret\u201d (OBSERVED)\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: infiltrator \u2192 defeated adversary\n- Tactics: illusion, deception, invisibility \u2192 none (neutralized)\n- Allegiance: hidden cultist \u2192 exposed traitor\n- Physical Condition: active combatant \u2192 \u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d\n- Mental State: controlled/manipulative \u2192 desperate, regretful",
